"""
AFC-DE: Adaptive Fuzzy Chance-Constrained Differential Evolution
================================================================
Reproducibility artefact for the manuscript:

    "Integrated Pickup-and-Delivery and Container Routing in Intermodal
     Hub-and-Spoke Networks Under Transit and Border Uncertainty:
     Evidence from the East African Corridor"

    Yves Ndikuriyo, Yinggui Zhang, Dung Davou Fom
    School of Traffic and Transportation Engineering
    Central South University, Changsha 410075, China

This script reproduces every table and figure in the manuscript's
Section 5 (Experimentation). It runs three methods (a greedy nearest-hub
heuristic, a deterministic-AFC-DE baseline, and the fuzzy-AFC-DE at four
confidence levels), three sensitivity analyses, and saves the results as
CSV/LaTeX tables, JSON output, and publication-quality figures.

Usage
-----
    python afc_de.py
    python afc_de.py --output-dir ./results --seed 42
    python afc_de.py --light          # reduces runs for laptops

Environment variables (optional):
    AFC_DE_OUTPUT_DIR   overrides the default output directory

See README.md for the full reproduction protocol.

